```

After that, list issues:

```graphql
{
  issues(filter: {
    state: {type: {eq: "Todo"}},
    assignee: {id: {eq: "<user-id>"}},
    team: {id: {eq: "<team-id>"}}
  }) {
    nodes { id identifier title estimate workflowState { name type } assignee { name } }
  }
}
```

Note: Linear's state filter uses workflow state types: backlog, todo, started, completed, canceled. "Todo" is a workflow state type.

